  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organization, Production and Distribution of Inter-Laboratory Comparison Tests</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USDA-APHIS supported the establishment of the South American Network of Avian Influenza and Newcastle Disease Diagnostic Laboratories - RESUDIA - in 2014 to strengthen the capacity of reference laboratories to diagnose avian influenza and the disease of Newcastle in the region. OIE designated a RESUDIA laboratory as a reference laboratory for avian influenze and Newcastle disease in May 2016, a significant accomplishment. Through this current project, APHIS will assist RESUDIA with it&apos;s next priority, the definition of mechanisms for production and distribution of reference materials and proficiency testing or interlaboratory tests within RESUDIA.</narrative>
  </description>
